    "claims": [
      "Maintains items, customers, vendors and related data like BOMs and routings centrally",
      "Syncs automatically with locations, subsidiaries, production sites and service providers",
      "Exchanges data across different BC or Navision versions and other ERPs such as SAP",
      "No limit on the number of tenants",
      "Supports drop shipments, global sourcing and cross-company inventories",
      "Converts purchase documents to sales documents and back",
      "Setup wizard with templates for national and international scenarios",
      "Fields and tables of other add-ons can be included by configuration",
      "Field authorizations separate central from local fields",
      "Helps meet SOX and 8th EU Directive requirements",
      "Automates exchange of purchase orders, sales orders, deliveries and invoices",
      "Shows item availability at international and external warehouses",
      "Maps units, delivery terms, payment terms and dimensions between companies",
      "Works with BC Essentials and Premium"
    ],
